  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>BONUS</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: <size=22>- 3  Bonus Symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers Free Games.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: "<size=18>- Wild Symbol displays a credit amount.\n\n- Whenever there is
      a win including Wild Symbol,\n   award the credit amount with symbol win pay.
      \n\n- If Wild Symbol is part of multiple wins, pay the\n   credit amount only
      once.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=21>- There is no limit on the number of spins during Free Games.\n\n-
      In Free Games, when a More Beer Symbol appears on a reel, a\n   spot is added
      to that reel, extending the height of the reel by 1.\n\n- More Beer Symbols
      appear on all reels and can expand the\n   height of the reels up to 6.\n\n-
      There are 3 kinds Oak Barrels above reels, displaying prizes.\n\n- When a reel
      expands to a height of 6, award the prize on the\n   Oak Barrel of the very
      same reel.\n\n- Golden Oak Barrel awards Grand Jackpot and then ends Free\n
      \  Games.\n<size=18>     - Winning Grand Jackpot when locked, award the total
      bet X100.\n</size>\n\n- Green Oak Barrel\_ awards the prize on it, resets the
      whole reel\n   size to 3x5 and game continues.\n\n- Red Oak Barrel awards the
      prize on it and then ends Free\n   Games.\n\n- Winning Red Oak Barrel along
      with either Green or Golden Oak\n   Barrel awards the prizes accordingly and
      then ends Free Games.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 75</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff></size>243 WAYS</size>
